    "https://launchpad.net/bugs/2175016"
  ],
  "description": "Stephan Lipp discovered that Ruby incorrectly handled converting the case\nof certain strings. An attacker could possibly use this issue to cause a\ndenial of service or execute arbitrary code. (GHSA-34m4-m9fh-gqp5)\n\nOwais Lone discovered that Ruby incorrectly handled compiling certain large\nregular expressions. An attacker could possibly use this issue to cause a\ndenial of service or execute arbitrary code. (GHSA-3p8q-wmhx-vm2w)\n\nStephan Lipp discovered that Ruby incorrectly handled converting certain\nregular expressions to strings. An attacker could possibly use this issue\nto cause a denial of service or execute arbitrary code. (GHSA-7whj-\ncfh7-xgm4)\n\nStephan Lipp discovered that Ruby incorrectly handled memory when parsing\ncertain regular expressions. An attacker could possibly use this issue to\ncause a denial of service or execute arbitrary code. (GHSA-7x2q-68qv-6p8x)\n\nIt was discovered that Ruby incorrectly handled converting the case of\ncertain large strings. An attacker could possibly use this issue to cause a\ndenial of service or execute arbitrary code. (GHSA-87fm-7w84-j2px)\n\nIt was discovered that Ruby incorrectly handled certain case-insensitive\nregular expressions. An attacker could possibly use this issue to cause a\ndenial of service or obtain sensitive information. (GHSA-pvgc-g7gj-pv6h)\n\nStephan Lipp discovered that Ruby incorrectly handled certain case-\ninsensitive regular expressions. An attacker could possibly use this issue\nto cause a denial of service or obtain sensitive information. (GHSA-\nwpqw-5qxg-m68r)",
  "id": "USN-9176-1",
  "isummary": "Several security issues were fixed in Ruby.",
